  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "樂讀音樂故事",
    "sub_ename": "STORYTELLING IN MUSIC",
    "describe_ch": "「樂讀音樂故事」課程將音樂視為生活濃縮的精粹、承載社會記憶與想望的社會建構。課程以音樂為觸發，深入探討人類情感與親密關係的演變以及社會發展與文化變遷，並引導學生連結音樂於個人生活品味的形塑。課程目標在於啟發學生認識多元文化與生活變遷、肯定自我、尊重差異，並培養跨領域知識整合與批判思考的能力。",
    "describe_eh": "The \"Storytelling in Music\" course views music as the essence of life, embodying social memories and aspirations as a social construct. The course uses music as a trigger to delve into the evolution of human emotions and intimate relationships, as well as social development and cultural changes. It guides students to connect music with the shaping of their personal tastes in life. The course aims to inspire students to recognize multiculturalism and life changes, affirm themselves, respect differences, and cultivate the ability to integrate interdisciplinary knowledge and critical thinking skills.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "能夠在課程中發現樂曲中所隱含的跨領域知識，增進對跨領域學習的興趣。",
      "describe_en": "Being able to discover the interdisciplinary knowledge embedded in the music during the course enhances interest in interdisciplinary learning."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "透過音樂中所隱含的文化議題認識並尊重多元價值，培養價值思辨能力。",
      "describe_en": "Recognize and respect diverse values through the cultural issues embedded in music, and cultivate the ability to think critically about values."
    }
  ],
